      "Responderé a la brevedad. No utilizo este canal para fines comerciales ni comparto tu correo con terceros.",
  },
  en: {
    lastUpdate: "September 25, 2026",
    title: "Privacy Policy — Sebastian Bravo",
    description:
      "Privacy policy for sebita.dev. Sebastian Bravo does not collect personal data. Static site with no analytics or tracking. Information about GDPR rights and Chilean data protection law.",
